sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as API Gateway
    participant R as Retriever
    participant P as Policy Check
    participant L as LLM/Mock
    participant C as Citation Assembler
    participant D as Audit Log

    U->>A: POST /ask {query}
    A->>R: Search entities/anomalies/observations
    R-->>A: Retrieved evidence (top-K)
    
    alt No evidence found
        A->>U: Return "Insufficient evidence"
        A->>D: Log query + empty result
    else Evidence exists
        A->>P: Validate grounding policy
        P-->>A: Policy approved
        
        A->>L: Generate response with grounded prompt
        L-->>A: Response + citations
        
        A->>C: Format with citations/confidence
        C-->>A: Formatted answer
        
        A->>D: Log query + response hash
        A->>U: Return {answer, citations, confidence, limitations}
    end

    Note over A,D: All steps logged to audit trail
    Note over L: Mock used if no API key
